wikimedia/wikipedia 20231101). bench/results/ contain answer keys and scores built from that text (CC BY-SA 4.0).

Not included: no fonts and no PDFs are distributed. Trusted reference fonts are supplied by the user (for example
Lohit or Noto, SIL OFL 1.1, or fonts installed on the user's own system under their own licences).

Dependencies (installed separately): Unshape (AGPL-3.0 or commercial, same author), HarfBuzz / uharfbuzz (MIT /
Apache-2.0), fontTools (MIT), PyMuPDF (AGPL-3.0 or commercial licence from Artifex).

